      "La amplitud es 0.9\n",
      "Los intervalos son: [20.95 21.85 22.75 23.65 24.55 25.45 26.35 27.25 28.15 29.05 29.95 30.85\n",
      " 31.75 32.65 33.55]\n",
      "Las marcas son: [21.4 22.3 23.2 24.1 25.  25.9 26.8 27.7 28.6 29.5 30.4 31.3 32.2 33.1]\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "# CÃ¡lculo de la amplitud\n",
    "A = round((max(cw)-min(cw))/raiz(cw), 1)\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"La amplitud es {}\".format(A))\n",
    "\n",
    "# Extremos de los intervalos\n",
    "L = np.zeros(raiz(cw) + 1)\n",
    "L[0] = min(cw) - 1 / 2 * 0.1\n",
    "for i in range(1, raiz(cw) + 1):\n",
    "    L[i] = L[0] + i * A\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"Los intervalos son: {}\".format(L))\n",
    "# Marcas de clase\n",
    "\n",
    "X = np.zeros(raiz(cw))\n",
    "X[0] = (L[0] + L[1])/2\n",
    "for i in range(1, raiz(cw)):\n",
    "    X[i] = (L[i] + L[i+1])/2\n",
    "    \n",
    "print(\"Las marcas son: {}\".format(X))"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "90142a5d-7fef-41c4-ac48-8cff2e6569e4",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Pregunta 3"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "e4bce449-dd68-4b52-b988-729fa2000391",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Da el algoritmo para reproducir el proceso de generaciÃ³n de clases y sus marcas donde el nÃºmero de clases ha sido obtenido con la regla de la Sturges en `Python`."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 6,
   "id": "c45d1842-4f43-45c5-b15b-f38e4605b01d",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "La amplitud es 1.4\n",
      "Los intervalos son: [20.95 22.35 23.75 25.15 26.55 27.95 29.35 30.75 32.15 33.55]\n",
      "Las marcas son: [21.65 23.05 24.45 25.85 27.25 28.65 30.05 31.45 32.85]\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "# CÃ¡lculo de la amplitud\n",
    "A = round((max(cw)-min(cw))/sturges(cw), 1)\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"La amplitud es {}\".format(A))\n",
    "\n",
    "# Extremos de los intervalos\n",
    "L = np.zeros(sturges(cw) + 1)\n",
    "L[0] = min(cw) - 1 / 2 * 0.1\n",
    "for i in range(1, sturges(cw) + 1):\n",
    "    L[i] = L[0] + i * A\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"Los intervalos son: {}\".format(L))\n",
    "# Marcas de clase\n",
    "\n",
    "X = np.zeros(sturges(cw))\n",
    "X[0] = (L[0] + L[1])/2\n",
    "for i in range(1, sturges(cw)):\n",
    "    X[i] = (L[i] + L[i+1])/2\n",
    "    \n",
    "print(\"Las marcas son: {}\".format(X))"
   ]
  },
  {
